---
import Private from '../../layouts/Private.astro';
import F from '../../components/PrivateFigure.astro';
const p = '/private/holmes-sage';
---
<Private
  title="SAGE portal workshop analysis"
  client="Holmes Corporation"
  color="#5B3FD6"
  back={{ href: '/work/holmes', label: 'Holmes Corporation case study' }}
  intro="The readout I prepared after facilitating the SAGE portal workshop, and how we got from ideas to priorities. Details are blurred."
>
  <F src={`${p}/01-analysis-cover.jpg`} width={2000} height={1161} alt="Cover slide: SAGE Portal Workshop Analysis" />

  <h2>Synthesis</h2>
  <p>I synthesized what stakeholders shared into an overview, audience needs and key considerations.</p>
  <F src={`${p}/02-overview-summary.jpg`} width={2000} height={1546} alt="Overview summary slide, details blurred" caption="The overview summary." />

  <h2>Direction</h2>
  <F src={`${p}/03-vision.jpg`} width={2000} height={1166} alt="Vision slide, details blurred" caption="A vision the group aligned on." />
  <F src={`${p}/04-key-outcomes.jpg`} width={2000} height={1499} alt="Key outcomes slide, details blurred" caption="The outcomes it has to deliver." />

  <h2>What to do first</h2>
  <p>We placed ideas on a priority and feasibility matrix, then turned the strongest into next steps and action items.</p>
  <F src={`${p}/07-priority-matrix-board.jpg`} width={2800} height={2894} alt="Priority matrix board, details blurred" caption="The priority matrix from the session." />
  <F src={`${p}/05-priority-matrix-analysis.jpg`} width={2800} height={2028} alt="Priority matrix analysis, details blurred" caption="The analysis behind the matrix." />
  <F src={`${p}/06-next-steps-action-items.jpg`} width={2000} height={2216} alt="Next steps and action items, details blurred" caption="Next steps and action items." />
  <F src={`${p}/08-recommended-next-steps.jpg`} width={2000} height={972} alt="Recommended next steps, details blurred" caption="My recommended next steps for the research and design work." />
</Private>
